{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261017/photo/bkn-20261017170937510-1017_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261017172718\"/><p>其中一輛私家車翻側。</p><p>銅鑼灣發生交通意外。今午(17日)4時，2輛私家車在體育道與黃泥涌道交界十字路口相撞，其中一輛私家車被撞至向右翻側，橫亘於路中。救護車接報抵達，司機報稱受傷，被送往律敦治醫院治療。受事故影響，上址交通受阻，直至拖車到場把翻側私家車扶正和拖走，交通始回復正常。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T09:39:36.588135+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T09:09:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T09:37:36.056117+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T09:37:36.056117+00:00","content_hash":"e48988a8f43bb85cc43771c5bd58bf26fabe64ee968bc2e8553e5ebff64cfc57","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}